# Webview UI

- Use strict CSP, nonces or static no-script rendering, and restricted `localResourceRoots`.
- Validate every message crossing the extension-host/webview boundary.
- Never render raw model output as trusted HTML.
- Use VS Code theme tokens and avoid color-only status indicators.
- Support keyboard navigation, focus management, screen-reader labels, and reduced motion.
